@page "/"

<PageTitle>Bsqlite lazy loading sample</PageTitle>

<h1>Lazy loading</h1>

<p>
    This page uses no database, so the browser has not downloaded <code>Bit.Bsqlite.wasm</code>, EF Core or the library
    with the app's model. Open the <a href="products">product list</a>: the router downloads them first, then renders it.
</p>
